{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112381","id":2975948548,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6xYV8E","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112381","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112381.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112381.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112381","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112381/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112381/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112381/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3afbb04e42a24e954829892b2ea53ecb842273f7","number":112381,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Don't right-align escaped newlines (e.g. for `#define`)","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Removes whitespace indentation for escaped newlines.\r\n\r\n### Motivation\r\n\r\nThis decouples the lines from one another for git diff purposes: When the backslashes are right-aligned, a change to the max size of the block changes all lines in it. \r\nThis leads to unnecessarily long change lists, increasing the chance and difficulty of merge conflicts, and makes it harder to view changes to these blocks in GitHub (e.g. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/78971/files, though notably, the \"hide whitespace\" option helps, if you know it exists). In addition, the `git blame` is unnecessarily modified, and line history browsers are harder to use.\r\n\r\nIt also makes it hard to hand-align these blocks, which means you need to run `pre-commit` while working on the code, or risk `pre-commit` changing it later. For me, this has led to unnecessary local recompilations.\r\n\r\n### Downsides\r\n\r\nThe main downside to this is that the code is arguably harder to read. \r\nGiven that C macros lead to difficult to read and error-prone code (for example, they are not [hygienic](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Macro_(computer_science)#Hygienic_macros)), we should be limiting their use anyway (and we do, for the most part). So I think this is an acceptable caveat.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOA